Concept | Meaning

Role Prompt | Tells the AI to behave from a particular role or
perspective, which influences tone, focus and response style.

System Prompt | Defines high-level rules, boundaries and allowed
behaviour that the assistant should follow.

Step-by-Step Solution | Breaks a task into visible, useful steps so the
user can understand and verify the result.

Prompt Refactoring | Improves an existing prompt by changing its
audience, tone, length, constraints or output format.

Constraints | Specific limits such as word count, topic boundaries,
required information or output style.